</section></score></mdiv></body>
<back><div type="verses">
<lg label="2."><l>There Manhood, all perfection,</l><l>And Godhead-fulness shine;</l><l>God’s love and Man’s affection,</l><l>The human, the divine;</l><l>A life, a death, transcendent,</l><l>Revealing God as love:</l><l>Here, lowly Man, dependent—</l><l>God over all, above!</l></lg>
<lg label="3."><l>Unsullied blaze of glory!</l><l>O ever-radiant Face!</l><l>Thy rich, unfathomed story</l><l>Transfigures us in grace!</l><l>Made like Thee, soon, completely,</l><l>With love-lit eyes we’ll scan</l><l>God’s face unveiled so sweetly</l><l>In Thine, Thou Son of man!</l></lg>
</div>
</back>
</music></mei>
